{"prepare":{"fields":{"imagepath":{"label":"Bildpfad","key":"hitmeister.imagepath","type":"text"},"condition":{"label":"Zustand","key":"hitmeister.itemcondition","type":"selection","values":null},"handlingtime":{"label":"Bearbeitungszeit","desc":"Voreinstellung f&uuml;r die Bearbeitungszeit (Zeit bis Versand). Diese kann bei Artikel-Vorbereitung noch angepa&szlig;t werden.<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>Hinweis:<\/b><br>\n\t\t\t\t\tWenn Sie \"Experteneinstellungen\" aktivieren (Button links unten), k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Bearbeitungszeit-Matching definieren, d.h. die Lieverzeiten, die Sie im Shop verwenden, den _#_platformName_#_-Bearbeitungseiten zuordnen, so dass jeder Artikel eine Bearbeitungseit entsprechend der Lieferzeit im Shop bekommt.","key":"hitmeister.handlingtime","type":"selection","values":null},"shippingtimeMatching":{"label":"Bearbeitungszeit Matching","key":"_#_platform_#_.shippingtimematching.values","type":"extern","cssClasses":["valignmid"],"procFunc":"ShippingtimeMatching","params":[],"expertsetting":true,"morefields":{"quantity":{"key":"_#_platform_#_.shippingtimematching.prefer","type":"checkbox","values":{"val":"Bearbeitungszeit Matching bevorzugen"},"default":{"val":false}}}},"location":{"label":"Land","key":"hitmeister.itemcountry","type":"selection","values":null,"desc":"Bitte w&auml;hlen Sie aus welchem Land Sie versenden. Im Normalfall ist es das Land in dem Ihr Shop liegt."},"shippinggroup":{"label":"Verk&auml;ufer-Versandgruppe","key":"_#_platform_#_.shippinggroup","type":"selection","values":null,"desc":"Die _#_platformName_#_-Verk&auml;ufer-Versandgruppen enthalten Angaben zum Versand."},"warehouse":{"label":"Warehouse","key":"_#_platform_#_.warehouse","type":"selection","values":null,"desc":"Select the _#_platformName_#_ warehouse where your items should be listed. If no warehouse is selected, _#_platformName_#_ will use the default warehouse of your seller account."},"manufacturerguaranteeyears":{"label":"Manufacturer guarantee (years)","desc":"Duration of the free manufacturer guarantee covering the whole product, in whole years (1 to 99). _#_platformName_#_ uses it for the EU guarantee label, but only for more than 2 years and only when manufacturer and manufacturer part number are present as well. The merchant's own guarantee or a paid guarantee extension does not belong in this field.<br \/><br \/>Select a shop attribute that holds the guarantee in years, or \"Specify your own values\" for one fixed value for all items. Values in months or with text (e.g. \"5 years\") are not transferred.<br \/><br \/>The value is sent when items are uploaded, not with the price and stock synchronisation. If nothing is selected, nothing is sent and a value entered at _#_platformName_#_ stays. A value once transferred can only be deleted in the _#_platformName_#_ Seller Portal.","key":"_#_platform_#_.manufacturerguaranteeyears","type":"selection","values":null,"morefields":{"value":{"key":"_#_platform_#_.manufacturerguaranteeyears.value","type":"text","cssClasses":["autoWidth"],"rightlabel":" years"}}},"itemsPerPage":{"label":"Ergebnisse","desc":"Hier k&ouml;nnen Sie festlegen, wie viele Produkte pro Seite beim Multimatching angezeigt werden sollen. <br\\\/>Je h&ouml;her die Anzahl, desto h&ouml;her auch die Ladezeit (bei 50 Ergebnissen ca. 30 Sekunden).","key":"hitmeister.multimatching.itemsperpage","type":"text","default":"10","cssClasses":["autoWidth"],"rightlabel":"pro Seite beim Multimatching","verify":"int"}}}}